  "prefLabel": "We 702.03 Discharge of Chlorinated Water",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 702.03 Discharge of Chlorinated Water. Chlorinated water pumped from wells following disinfection shall not be discharged into any surface water of the state.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
